    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t2_gc_note",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 548,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "Arrow buffers live off-heap in pooled native memory - a 32 MB\nbatch is invisible to the GC. DuckDB reads the connector's\nbuffers directly; no per-value marshaling anywhere.",
