    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sink_text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 886,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 51,
      "text": "native copy: the sink returns COPY (SELECT * FROM staging.order_totals) TO 'out/totals/' (FORMAT csv) - DuckDB writes directly.\nuniversal:   DuckDB result stream -> bounded channel -> ISinkWriteSession.WriteBatchAsync per batch, then Commit XOR Abort.\ntemp-write + atomic swap makes write.strategy: replace all-or-nothing - a failed run never leaves a half-replaced output.",
      "originalText": "native copy: the sink returns COPY (SELECT * FROM staging.order_totals) TO 'out/totals/' (FORMAT csv) - DuckDB writes directly.\nuniversal:   DuckDB result stream -> bounded channel -> ISinkWriteSession.WriteBatchAsync per batch, then Commit XOR Abort.\ntemp-write + atomic swap makes write.strategy: replace all-or-nothing - a failed run never leaves a half-replaced output.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
