    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "vol_intro",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1012,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "within a run, data never arrives 'all at once': it streams as ~32 MB Arrow batches (tier 2) or a DuckDB scan (tier 1).\nwhat IS configurable is how much of the dataset each run claims:",
